+                          cpre[x, 1], cpre[x, 4], cu[x, 1], cu[x, 4]))
resource_density_z       0.336 (p=0.074)    -0.148 (p=0.206)
friction_z              -0.412 (p=0.055)    -0.239 (p=0.250)
